@PACKAGE@ for Debian
====================

Firmware
--------

This package does not ship tuner firmware. The vendor firmware is proprietary
and carries no redistribution grant, so it cannot be part of this package. The
administrator has to install it.

The @PROFILE@ profile needs one of: @FIRMWARE_LIST@

Place the file in /lib/firmware/ and reload the module, or replug the device.
Some of these files are shipped by Debian in firmware-linux-nonfree or
firmware-misc-nonfree; the rest come from the tuner vendor.

Module override
---------------

DKMS installs into /lib/modules/<kernel>/updates/dkms/, which takes precedence
over the in-tree modules of the same name. For this profile that affects:
@OVERRIDE_LIST@

If a name above also exists in your running kernel, the out-of-tree version
replaces it for *all* devices that use it, not only for this tuner. On a host
with other DVB hardware, check that those devices still work after installing
this package.

Source
------

The driver sources are a reduced copy of https://github.com/tbsdtv/linux_media
plus the patch series carried by this project. The exact commit and patch list
used for this build are recorded in
/usr/src/@MODULE@-@VERSION@/PROVENANCE.
